    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Children ride the Laminate Standing Merry-Go-Round on their feet. They stand on a yellow platform and hold a central steering wheel while it turns, which takes more balance than a seated ride. It is designed for the 5 to 10 years Key User Group and carries four children at a time. The platform is 4' x 4' and the safe play area is 10' x 10'. Standing play gives older children a bit more challenge, so this suits a primary school or a park where the younger merry-go-rounds feel too tame. Colours are Play Yellow and Knight Blue. Composite laminates and galvanised pipes come with our 3-year warranty, and bearings with 1 year. Ask us for a quote."
     }
    ]
   }
