    "pText": "The standing deck is composite laminate on a galvanised steel frame, which resists moisture and corrosion. We install it self-standing or grouted. Keep the 10' x 10' area clear and use an impact-absorbing surface, since children may step off while it is still turning. Check the steering wheel and bearing during maintenance.",
